    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\"><style>[data-colorid=kbsyai3lk8]{color:#333333} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=kbsyai3lk8]{color:#cccccc}[data-colorid=dakm5iont7]{color:#333333} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=dakm5iont7]{color:#cccccc}</style>\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"ConfigureLaboratoryManagementSystem(OpenELIS)-Steps\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Steps</span></h2><h3 id=\"ConfigureLaboratoryManagementSystem(OpenELIS)-1.ConfigureLabDatainOpenMRS\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">1.&nbsp;Configure Lab Data in OpenMRS</span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Please refer to&nbsp;<a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/18415840/Configure+Lab+Data\" data-linked-resource-id=\"18415840\" data-linked-resource-version=\"7\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Lab Data</a>&nbsp;to setup&nbsp;</span>OpenMRS Reference Data setup for Lab</p><h3 id=\"ConfigureLaboratoryManagementSystem(OpenELIS)-2.SetupaLabTest\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">2. Set up a Lab Test</span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">1. Create a&nbsp;<a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/50921567/Configure+Concept+or+Concept+Set\" data-linked-resource-id=\"50921567\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">concept</a>&nbsp;in OpenMRS of the class&nbsp;<em>LabTest</em>.</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\" id=\"ConfigureLaboratoryManagementSystem(OpenELIS)-\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202016-02-18%20at%204.39.08%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482301711257&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=419\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202016-02-18%20at%204.39.08%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482301711257&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"109314072\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-02-18 at 4.39.08 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"109314082\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"e9af8439-6738-4201-9f38-4b55f849d78b\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202016-02-18%20at%204.39.08%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482301711257&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1154&amp;height=691 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202016-02-18%20at%204.39.08%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482301711257&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=419 1x\" /></span></span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">2. Specify the data type&nbsp;</span><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">as text, numeric or coded. If data type is set as coded, the test result options will appear as a dropdown in OpenELIS.</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">3. Add the lab test concept to the relevant concept sets:</span></p><ul><li><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">sample concept set</span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">panel concept set</span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">department concept set</span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">all tests and panels concept set in OpenMRS.</span></p></li></ul><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">4. The lab test will be visible under the Orders tab in consultation page of Bahmni.</span></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202016-02-18%20at%206.06.28%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482301710683&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=373\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202016-02-18%20at%206.06.28%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482301710683&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"109314073\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-02-18 at 6.06.28 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"109314082\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"57b7e463-6108-4c9e-a9fb-21dc63456f7b\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202016-02-18%20at%206.06.28%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482301710683&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1381&amp;height=736 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202016-02-18%20at%206.06.28%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482301710683&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=373 1x\" /></span></p><p>5.&nbsp;After the test is created in OpenMRS, it syncs to the list of tests in OpenELIS and is visible under the sample it was added in OpenMRS.</p><h3 id=\"ConfigureLaboratoryManagementSystem(OpenELIS)-3.ReferaTest\">3. Refer a Test</h3><p>OpenELIS has a test attribute which can mark the test as &quot;Referred Out&quot;. This is used if the hospital's laboratory cannot perform a test and have to refer the patient to another laboratory for that test. If&nbsp;this attribute is selected, the test is automatically displayed as referred out which saves the manual effort of the lab technician to mark the test referred out each time it is ordered.</p><p>To set up the test as referred out -</p><p>1. Go to the Admin page in OpenELIS and select &quot;Test&quot; from the panel on the left.</p><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\" id=\"ConfigureLaboratoryManagementSystem(OpenELIS)-.1\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202016-02-22%20at%2011.50.23%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482301709827&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=354\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202016-02-22%20at%2011.50.23%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482301709827&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"109314074\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-02-22 at 11.50.23 AM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"109314082\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"15eb6124-3b11-447f-9abd-705e48261d2c\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202016-02-22%20at%2011.50.23%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482301709827&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=708 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202016-02-22%20at%2011.50.23%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482301709827&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=354 1x\" /></span></h3><p>2. Select the test and click Edit. Select the checkbox to mark the test as &quot;Referred Out&quot;.</p><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\" id=\"ConfigureLaboratoryManagementSystem(OpenELIS)-.2\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202016-02-22%20at%2011.34.10%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482301709060&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=214\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202016-02-22%20at%2011.34.10%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482301709060&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"109314075\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-02-22 at 11.34.10 AM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"109314082\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"6f1ecf71-8fde-4ea7-9474-3f9e08d3fcfc\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202016-02-22%20at%2011.34.10%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482301709060&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=428 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202016-02-22%20at%2011.34.10%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482301709060&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=214 1x\" /></span></h3><h3 id=\"ConfigureLaboratoryManagementSystem(OpenELIS)-4.SampleSourceConfiginOpenElis\"><strong style=\"font-size: 16.0px;\">4. Sample Source Config in OpenElis</strong></h3><p>When a &nbsp;lab order is placed in EMR for a patient, that information will sync to OpenElis. When the order is synced to Elis, sample source will be the location from which Order has been placed in EMR. And SampleSource field is <strong>non editable</strong> when lab order is synced from EMR to Elis. If the location from which lab order is placed in EMR is not a sample source in Elis, then it will create a new sample source with that location name. Please refer to the attached diagrams:</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span data-colorid=\"kbsyai3lk8\">Here Test Patient has DLC panel ordered from Registration Desk location</span></p><p><br /><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" alt=\"Here Test Patient has DLC panel ordered from Registration Desk location\" height=\"250\" width=\"733\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202017-01-12%20at%202.55.04%20PM.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1484213406933&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=733&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202017-01-12%20at%202.55.04%20PM.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1484213406933&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"113868803\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-01-12 at 2.55.04 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"109314082\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"ae36673f-1aca-4405-a654-1f9b1787b077\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"Here Test Patient has DLC panel ordered from Registration Desk location\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202017-01-12%20at%202.55.04%20PM.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1484213406933&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1345&amp;height=459 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202017-01-12%20at%202.55.04%20PM.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1484213406933&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=733&amp;height=250 1x\" /></span><br /><br /><span data-colorid=\"dakm5iont7\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Lab order has Sample Source as Registration Desk and it is non editable</span><br /><br /><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" alt=\"Lab order has Sample Source as Registration Desk and it is non editable\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/screenshot-192.168.33.10-2017-01-12-15-03-19.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484213689956&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=499\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/109314082/screenshot-192.168.33.10-2017-01-12-15-03-19.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484213689956&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"113868805\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"screenshot-192.168.33.10-2017-01-12-15-03-19.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"109314082\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"31e3967d-9021-41ea-a774-6fd8378810f8\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"Lab order has Sample Source as Registration Desk and it is non editable\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/screenshot-192.168.33.10-2017-01-12-15-03-19.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484213689956&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1200&amp;height=998 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/screenshot-192.168.33.10-2017-01-12-15-03-19.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484213689956&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=499 1x\" /></span></p><p><strong style=\"font-size: 16.0px;\">5. Link Sample Source and Location</strong></p><p>&nbsp;When&nbsp;a lab order is directly placed in Elis user can chose any sample source from the available list. That lab order and result will sync back to EMR based on which location that sample source is associated with. A sample source association with location can be done in two ways.</p><ol><li>&nbsp;If a lab order is synced from EMR to Elis and there is no sample source with that name it will automatically create a new sample source with location name in Elis. And it will add an entry into external reference table with newly created sample source id as item_id, locaitonUuid as external_reference_id, &quot;SampleSource&quot; as type.&nbsp;</li><li>Manually associating a sample source with location.&nbsp;One can associate sample source with location by running a insert query into external_reference table.</li></ol><p><br /></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"bf5d8129-33c4-46a6-9934-f089370a0d44\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Insert query</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: sql; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">insert into external_reference(item_id, external_id, type) VALUES (&lt;itemId&gt;,&lt;locationUuid&gt;,'SampleSource');</pre>\n</div></div><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"7b1ce11d-cbcb-4f52-ab4a-0aa49f90ec44\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Example</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: sql; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">insert into external_reference(item_id, external_id, type) VALUES (9,'8d6c993e-c2cc-11de-8d13-0010c6dffd0f','SampleSource');</pre>\n</div></div><p><br /></p><p>If a sample source is not associated with any location then that lab order/lab result will not sync to EMR. That information will be there in failed events table. If a sample source is linked with a location, but if that location is not existed in EMR or if it is not a visit location, then sync will not happen.</p><p>One can manually insert the sample source into sample_source table by using the following query.</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"9ccad958-ce3c-48ab-bad9-4644db6b2d84\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>insert sample source</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: sql; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">insert into sample_source(name,active, display_order) VALUES (&lt;sampleSourceName&gt;,&lt;true/false&gt;,&lt;displayOrderValue&gt;);\n\n</pre>\n</div></div><p>Example:</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"85fc2528-d308-4517-b2fc-2e0d5cf8c505\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Example</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: sql; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">insert into sample_source(name, active, display_order) VALUES ('example sample source',true,11);</pre>\n</div></div><p><br /></p><h3 id=\"ConfigureLaboratoryManagementSystem(OpenELIS)-6.ConfigureDefaultSamplesourceinOpenElis\"><strong>6. Configure Default Sample source in OpenElis</strong></h3><p>User can configure a default sample source. The value for the default sample source is the name of the existing sample source. If default sample source is not configured, by default empty value will be shown while ordering the lab order from OpenElis for a patient. If default sample source is configured then sample source will be pre populate with the configured value(if it exist as a sample source in elis) in add sample page. To configure default sample source please follow the steps.</p><p>1.&nbsp;Go to &nbsp;Administration, click on site information.</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202017-01-12%20at%203.51.53%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484216746251&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=493&amp;height=150\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202017-01-12%20at%203.51.53%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484216746251&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"113868816\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-01-12 at 3.51.53 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"109314082\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"a2bef286-cc91-4830-867c-21ccba284fe2\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202017-01-12%20at%203.51.53%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484216746251&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=986&amp;height=300 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/Screen%20Shot%202017-01-12%20at%203.51.53%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484216746251&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=493&amp;height=150 1x\" /></span></p><p>2. Select default sample source and add/edit the value for default sample source.</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/screenshot-192.168.33.10-2017-01-12-15-56-48.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484216871567&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=448&amp;height=150\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/109314082/screenshot-192.168.33.10-2017-01-12-15-56-48.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484216871567&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"113868818\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"screenshot-192.168.33.10-2017-01-12-15-56-48.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"109314082\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"d169ab7e-5158-48e0-8d7b-82df64bacd06\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/screenshot-192.168.33.10-2017-01-12-15-56-48.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484216871567&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=896&amp;height=300 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/109314082/screenshot-192.168.33.10-2017-01-12-15-56-48.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484216871567&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=448&amp;height=150 1x\" /></span></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"8450e577-7882-4e1b-ae52-c2950ec062ba\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"2ecf4e5d-ee5a-47a2-8fca-c2f2091f69d8\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32604211/Laboratory+Management\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32604211\" data-linked-resource-version=\"7\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Laboratory Management - Feature Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"b94e3ad7-5c3a-4de1-9e38-0d0d4195b78d\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Usage Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014358/Laboratory\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014358\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Laboratory Management - User Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"93152c5d-6bea-40d9-a973-a55a64c04d31\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>Related Links</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/18415840/Configure+Lab+Data\" data-linked-resource-id=\"18415840\" data-linked-resource-version=\"7\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Lab Master Data Setup</a></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
